{"id": 14311, "name": "Kool Lakes Family RV Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://koollakes.com/", "lines": []}, {"url": "https://koollakes.com/campsites-garrettsville-oh/", "lines": [" pets or smoking in our rental cabins. 2026 Camping Rates | All listed rates are for a \"family of four\"—two adults and two children under 18 or three adults. For groups exceeding the family of four standard, there is an $8 overnight stay charge per person. For daytime visitors, there is a $5 charge per person. You may have a maximum of six people per site. Check-in starts at 1:00 PM; there is an extra charge for earl", "rs, there is a $5 charge per person. You may have a maximum of six people per site. Check-in starts at 1:00 PM; there is an extra charge for early check-in. Check-out must be done by noon. A security/cleaning deposit of $30.00 is due at check-in and will be returned following a successful inspection at check-out. Kool Kampsites | A one-night deposit is required for all Kool Kampsite reservations. A two-night deposit ", "deposit is required for all Kool Kampsite reservations. A two-night deposit is required for holiday weekends. There are no deposit refunds for holiday weekends. KOOL KAMPSITES | Daily Weekly Monthly | Water & Electric | $60 | $370 | CALL | | Water, Electric, & Sewer | $65 | $400 | CALL | | Kool Kabins | All Kool Kabin reservations must be prepaid. Reservations are accepted for a minimum of two nights. There are no de", ", & Sewer | $65 | $400 | CALL | | Kool Kabins | All Kool Kabin reservations must be prepaid. Reservations are accepted for a minimum of two nights. There are no deposit returns for our rental cabins. Large Kabin a night $95 | Tiny Kabin a night $55 | Seasonal Campsites Available | Save big with our seasonal campsite rates. These spots first come, first served; reserve now while we still have some left. You may pay fo", "Seasonal Campsites Available | Save big with our seasonal campsite rates. These spots first come, first served; reserve now while we still have some left. You may pay for seasonal camping online. Large seasonal campsite $2450 | Regular seasonal campsite $2350 | Additional Charges | Extra Person 17 yrs. or Younger – $55 | Extra Person 18 yrs. or Older – $70 | On-Site Winter Storage – $150.00 | All seasonal campsites i", "ill have some left. You may pay for seasonal camping online. Large seasonal campsite $2450 | Regular seasonal campsite $2350 | Additional Charges | Extra Person 17 yrs. or Younger – $55 | Extra Person 18 yrs. or Older – $70 | On-Site Winter Storage – $150.00 | All seasonal campsites include water and piped sewer. All sites come with 50/30/20-amp electricity that is metered and billed monthly by the kilowatt. Gas and ", "arts are allowed for licensed drivers. Swimming | Ohio camping is even better with water activities. All campers swim and fish for free. No fishing license is required. Non-campers ages six and older may swim for a flat $5 per day. Children five and younger swim for free. No fishing is allowed for non-campers. Summer Season Office Hours | Monday – Thursday, 11:00 AM – 5:00 PM | Friday, 11:00 AM – 9:00 PM | Saturday, "], "via": "Facilities & Rates"}, {"url": "https://koollakes.com/family-friendly-campground-garrettsville-oh/", "lines": [], "via": "Seasonal Pics"}, {"url": "https://koollakes.com/contact-us/", "lines": [], "via": "Contact & Reservation"}]}
{"id": 14378, "name": "White Oak Pastures RV Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://whiteoakpastures.com/pages/wop-lodging", "lines": ["Cabin Rentals – White Oak Pastures Skip to content Pause slideshow Play slideshow Free shipping On ground network orders over $249 $15 Perishable Shipping On ground network orders over $149 icon-X Close menu Workshops Learn About Workshops | Workshop Tickets | Center for Agricultural Resilience (CFAR) | CFAR Tickets | | Lodg", "ng at WOP | Book Your Stay | | Farm Tours Equine Trail Rides | About Farm Tours | | General Store | Dining | Log in | instagram Instagram | Facebook | YouTube | X | Pinterest | Cart icon-X Close cart Order note Subtotal $0.00 Shipping, taxes, and discount codes calculated at checkout. | I agree with the terms and conditions . | Check out Your cart is currently empty. Workshops Learn About Workshops | Workshop Tickets", "odations are certainly pet friendly! We do ask that dogs are kept on leashes while out exploring the farm because we do have guard dogs that roam and protect our herds and flocks from sharp tooth predators. Pet fees are $75.00 for the first pet and $25.00 for every additional pet. | There’s plenty to do in South Georgia. You can stay busy with a tour of our farm, local hikes, and visits to other local tourist attract", "rip to our farm Makerspace, where guests will learn about our leather workshop/tallow kitchen/hide-barn pet chew operations. | | • Length: Approximately 1 hour | | • Available at 10:00 am by appointment only | | • Cost: $60 Minimum, which covers a group of 4. Additional adults will be charged $15/person. | | • Group Rates: available, call to discuss (229) 641-2081 | | • Lunch: sold separately | | Saturday Walking Tou", "ditional adults will be charged $15/person. | | • Group Rates: available, call to discuss (229) 641-2081 | | • Lunch: sold separately | | Saturday Walking Tour: A walking tour is given each Saturday at 11:00 AM. Cost is $15 per person with no re